WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:04.500
Devil fruits are one of my favorite parts
of One Piece!

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:10.170
And apparently they are yours too because
you all submitted nearly TWO THOUSAND SUBMISSIONS

00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:11.650
to my devil fruit contest.

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:16.119
And there were SO MANY incredible options
to choose from that I just couldn’t stop

00:00:16.119 --> 00:00:22.000
at one video so here are twenty more of your
most MIND-BLOWING devil fruits that should

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.520
absolutely exist in One Piece.

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:31.660
Starting with one of the most creative ideas
I’ve ever heard of which is the Tattoo devil

00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:33.090
fruit submitted by Ethan.

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:37.820
Basically, this ability allows you to draw
tattoos all over your body and then turn those

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:39.950
tattoos into real actions.

00:00:39.950 --> 00:00:43.329
For example, imagine you drew a sword tattoo
on your arm.

00:00:43.329 --> 00:00:48.000
Well, when you need a slicing attack you simply
use that sword tattoo and it appears as a

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.300
slicing attack to cut down your enemies.

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:54.110
Or imagine you drew a giant pair of wings
on your back.

00:00:54.110 --> 00:00:58.730
Then using THAT tattoo would allow you to
fly for a short period of time.

00:00:58.730 --> 00:01:05.979
So yeah, an incredibly useful fruit in almost
any situation as long as you have the creativity

00:01:05.979 --> 00:01:08.939
and skill to draw many different tattoos.

00:01:08.939 --> 00:01:16.460
Now to make this fruit fair, a good restriction
is that once you use a tattoo it disappears

00:01:16.460 --> 00:01:17.460
from your body.

00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:20.850
So no, you can’t just infinitely spam that
sword tattoo you drew.

00:01:20.850 --> 00:01:25.900
That also means you are going to have to be
careful about which tattoos you use.

00:01:25.900 --> 00:01:31.220
Also, another incredible ability of this fruit
could be that the larger you draw the tattoo

00:01:31.220 --> 00:01:33.549
the more powerful it becomes.

00:01:33.549 --> 00:01:38.110
For example, imagine you drew a wave tattoo
to send out water.

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:42.040
Well, if the tattoo is small like as big as
your hand, then it probably would just be

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:43.570
a small burst of water.

00:01:43.570 --> 00:01:48.530
But then imagine that you drew the wave across
your entire chest, well, then you might get

00:01:48.530 --> 00:01:53.960
a giant tsunami to wash away all of your opponents.

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:59.490
So yeah, these are exactly the kinds of creative
fruits I love to see that can be used in combat

00:01:59.490 --> 00:02:02.439
but also in so many other situations.

00:02:02.439 --> 00:02:07.890
However, even the tattoo fruit would likely
get overwhelmed by the sheer power of the

00:02:07.890 --> 00:02:11.330
Sound devil fruit submitted by Gelo Boi Is
Cool.

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:17.220
And this one is just all kinds of powerful
because this Logia fruit transforms you into

00:02:17.220 --> 00:02:23.120
a Sound Wave human capable of becoming AND
producing all types of sound waves.

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:27.970
And at first you might be thinking, well that
doesn’t sound so cool, but TRUST ME.

00:02:27.970 --> 00:02:30.750
THIS FRUIT IS INSANE!

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:36.060
Because sound waves are literally EVERYWHERE,
ALL THE TIME.

00:02:36.060 --> 00:02:42.099
So this user can obviously send out sound
waves to make crushing sonic booms or they

00:02:42.099 --> 00:02:46.060
can make different voices all around to confuse
people.

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:50.569
You also get incredible speed because you
can travel at the speed of sound.

00:02:50.569 --> 00:02:54.800
That’s not all though because if your sound
waves are strong enough they can even act

00:02:54.800 --> 00:02:59.680
like a physical attack to knock people down,
kinda like how you can feel the air vibrating

00:02:59.680 --> 00:03:05.400
in front of a super loud speaker.

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:09.201
But to get to the most broken part of this
fruit, we need to dive into science for just

00:03:09.201 --> 00:03:14.349
a moment because recent research has even
shown that people’s brains can be somewhat

00:03:14.349 --> 00:03:17.850
controlled by certain sound waves.

00:03:17.850 --> 00:03:23.819
So yeah, an extremely skilled user of this
fruit can possibly even influence a person’s

00:03:23.819 --> 00:03:25.920
behavior to a certain extent.

00:03:25.920 --> 00:03:31.670
However, there is one major drawback and that
is because sound waves can be blocked by physical

00:03:31.670 --> 00:03:36.599
objects, so this fruit can be majorly nerfed
if the target is hiding behind a wall or something.

00:03:36.599 --> 00:03:46.750
So while that may keep some people away from
the sound fruit, I can’t think of anyone

00:03:46.750 --> 00:03:49.170
who wouldn’t want this next fruit.

00:03:49.170 --> 00:03:54.060
That’s because Pete Culver from the United
States submitted the Kibo Kibo no mi, otherwise

00:03:54.060 --> 00:03:56.720
known as the Wish fruit.

00:03:56.720 --> 00:04:01.980
And just like it sounds, this is the classic
genie in a bottle ability which grants the

00:04:01.980 --> 00:04:05.200
user exactly three wishes.

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:12.290
And man what a RIDICULOUS POWER because with
this fruit you could literally take over the

00:04:12.290 --> 00:04:13.290
world.

00:04:13.290 --> 00:04:15.860
Want to become ruler of the world government?

00:04:15.860 --> 00:04:16.860
Just wish for it.

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:20.260
Or how about becoming the richest person in
the world?

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:21.260
Easy.

00:04:21.260 --> 00:04:26.050
Or you want to own one of the strongest weapons
in the world?

00:04:26.050 --> 00:04:27.050
Done.

00:04:27.050 --> 00:04:33.050
But as cool as this fruit is, we just have
to include some restrictions such as you can’t

00:04:33.050 --> 00:04:34.860
just wish for someone to be dead.

00:04:34.860 --> 00:04:39.740
No wishing for the ability to swim, since
that defeats the main weakness of a devil

00:04:39.740 --> 00:04:40.740
fruit.

00:04:40.740 --> 00:04:44.949
No wishing for more wishes or something that
completely breaks reality.

00:04:44.949 --> 00:04:49.789
Oh yeah, and you have to be super specific
about your wishes.

00:04:49.789 --> 00:04:55.270
For example, if you just wish for something
like super strength, well this fruit can give

00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:59.259
you that, but it might not be exactly what
you were hoping for.

00:04:59.259 --> 00:05:04.910
Because sure you can have super strength,
but maybe only for five seconds.

00:05:04.910 --> 00:05:10.190
In the right hands though, and with some careful
wishing, this fruit could easily help you

00:05:10.190 --> 00:05:11.780
take over the world.

00:05:11.780 --> 00:05:17.680
What’s crazy though is that this next fruit
might be even better than the Wish fruit in

00:05:17.680 --> 00:05:19.520
the hands of the right person.

00:05:19.520 --> 00:05:23.460
Because now we have the Build fruit submitted
by Flopo from Germany.

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:28.330
And just like it sounds, this fruit allows
the user to build anything they can imagine

00:05:28.330 --> 00:05:31.690
as long as they have the right materials nearby.

00:05:31.690 --> 00:05:34.050
Which is SO USEFUL.

00:05:34.050 --> 00:05:39.169
I mean with this fruit if you are somewhere
like Marineford with lots of stone, metal,

00:05:39.169 --> 00:05:43.650
guns, and swords everywhere you could make
yourself a giant mech suit full of slashing

00:05:43.650 --> 00:05:45.250
blades and powerful guns.

00:05:45.250 --> 00:05:49.680
And if that’s not enough, you could turn
the stone beneath you into a giant castle

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:51.080
for defense.

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:57.699
But this fruit is even more useful outside
of battle because it could also make you filthy

00:05:57.699 --> 00:05:58.699
rich.

00:05:58.699 --> 00:06:03.800
For example, you instantly become the world’s
best one-man construction company where you

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:10.509
can make houses, buildings, or even this world
government’s giant bridge with incredible

00:06:10.509 --> 00:06:11.509
speed.

00:06:11.509 --> 00:06:16.930
However, one downside of this fruit is that
you can’t really change your available resources

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:20.569
too much, so you basically use what you’ve
got.

00:06:20.569 --> 00:06:26.191
However, just wait until you see another power
in just a minute that will make the Build

00:06:26.191 --> 00:06:29.530
fruit look like a child’s construction kit.

00:06:29.530 --> 00:06:36.889
First though, we have the first of many super
creative Zoan fruits with the Gecko fruit

00:06:36.889 --> 00:06:38.800
submitted by Brendan from the United States.

00:06:38.800 --> 00:06:44.300
And now at first this may sound a bit disappointing,
but just listen to the incredible abilities

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:45.979
that Geckos possess.

00:06:45.979 --> 00:06:52.979
First, they get the obvious normal zoan abilities
like a full Gecko form and a Gecko-human hybrid

00:06:52.979 --> 00:06:53.979
form.

00:06:53.979 --> 00:06:57.400
And alongside this you get the ability to
climb walls with your sticky hands.

00:06:57.400 --> 00:07:01.770
Your Gecko body instantly becomes poisonous
to touch because many Geckos are covered with

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:03.460
poisonous slime.

00:07:03.460 --> 00:07:07.900
Along with this you can shoot out poison at
enemies, look in two different directions

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:11.169
at once, and use enhanced hearing.

00:07:11.169 --> 00:07:17.699
But on top of all that, there are two incredible
abilities that also make just way too much

00:07:17.699 --> 00:07:19.199
sense with this fruit.

00:07:19.199 --> 00:07:24.259
First, lizards are well known to be able to
regenerate parts of their body, so a slow

00:07:24.259 --> 00:07:27.919
regeneration ability would make a lot of sense
with this fruit.

00:07:27.919 --> 00:07:33.639
Plus we could also give it a camouflage power
since many lizards are experts at blending

00:07:33.639 --> 00:07:35.400
in with their environments.

00:07:35.400 --> 00:07:41.520
And that extra stealth factor makes it perfect
for someone like a secret agent or a sneaky

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:43.419
character like Sanji.

00:07:43.419 --> 00:07:51.930
However, there’s probably no sneakier fruit
than this next one which is the Phase devil

00:07:51.930 --> 00:07:54.430
fruit submitted by S-Stinger from Canada.

00:07:54.430 --> 00:08:00.229
And to explain this fruit, basically think
of yourself like a ghost where you can turn

00:08:00.229 --> 00:08:03.069
your body into an untouchable substance.

00:08:03.069 --> 00:08:08.610
This ability would let you walk through walls
with ease, sink into the ground, and pop back

00:08:08.610 --> 00:08:13.740
up in another place, and even make you immune
from most normal attacks since they would

00:08:13.740 --> 00:08:15.479
just pass right through you.

00:08:15.479 --> 00:08:20.520
And man can you just imagine someone literally
just popping out of a wall or the ground?

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:23.770
It’d be like the ultimate jump scare ability.

00:08:23.770 --> 00:08:29.009
On top of that though it is great for sneaking
around and gathering information.

00:08:29.009 --> 00:08:34.050
Enemies also wouldn’t be able to hit you,
although it’s not great for attacking because

00:08:34.050 --> 00:08:39.610
you also can’t hit anything while you are
in your untouchable state.

00:08:39.610 --> 00:08:45.040
However, the awakening of this fruit could
really unlock its full potential.

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:49.560
Because if the user awakens this fruit they
would be able to give their phase ability

00:08:49.560 --> 00:08:52.560
to any object around them.

00:08:52.560 --> 00:08:57.680
So if a friend is trapped in handcuffs, you
can Phase them right out.

00:08:57.680 --> 00:09:03.180
And this would be even more perfect for a
sniper like Usopp who could even make his

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:09.339
projectiles pass through walls to hit enemies
on the other side.

00:09:09.339 --> 00:09:15.170
Now, this next fruit is going to take things
to an entirely new level.

00:09:15.170 --> 00:09:20.700
That’s because Kiefster’s Summon Summon
no mi is an ability that lets you summon creatures

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:22.680
to fight for you in battle.

00:09:22.680 --> 00:09:27.950
And this is a pretty common ability that we’ve
seen in other anime, but essentially this

00:09:27.950 --> 00:09:33.430
fruit would let you call out monsters or other
creatures to fight for you.

00:09:33.430 --> 00:09:38.200
Classic magic user, just sits back and lets
others fight for them.

00:09:38.200 --> 00:09:44.440
But what’s cool about this power is that
you would start off with some basic creatures

00:09:44.440 --> 00:09:49.750
that you can summon, but as you get stronger
and better with the fruit then those creatures

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:54.130
evolve to become terrifying monsters on the
battlefield.

00:09:54.130 --> 00:09:59.250
Another special ability that makes this fruit
unbelievably awesome is that you can make

00:09:59.250 --> 00:10:05.220
contracts with other animals you find in the
world so that you can summon them as well.

00:10:05.220 --> 00:10:10.649
And can you just imagine a master of this
fruit summoning a whole force of the most

00:10:10.649 --> 00:10:12.760
powerful creatures in the world?

00:10:12.760 --> 00:10:17.120
Giant lions, gorillas, snakes, even sea kings.

00:10:17.120 --> 00:10:23.269
Truly, mastering this fruit makes you an entire
world-conquering army all by yourself.

00:10:23.269 --> 00:10:29.800
But even summoning an entire army isn’t
even as game-changing a power as the Truth

00:10:29.800 --> 00:10:33.640
devil fruit submitted by CJ from the United
States.

00:10:33.640 --> 00:10:38.940
And just like it sounds, this fruit allows
you to force someone to answer your questions

00:10:38.940 --> 00:10:40.120
truthfully.

00:10:40.120 --> 00:10:44.500
Which is pretty simple, but let’s break
down how it actually works.

00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:50.600
First, you must make eye contact with a person
and then you can activate your power.

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:56.579
This forces the person into a trance-like
state where they must answer any of your questions

00:10:56.579 --> 00:10:59.180
for a short period of time.

00:10:59.180 --> 00:11:05.389
So yeah, remember when this guy casually dropped
a hint about the National Treasure of Mary

00:11:05.389 --> 00:11:08.260
Geoise and we all desperately wanted to know
more?

00:11:08.260 --> 00:11:13.450
Well with this fruit, you could simply make
him tell you everything that he knows about

00:11:13.450 --> 00:11:14.450
the treasure.

00:11:14.450 --> 00:11:19.550
And with this type of intelligence gathering
power, you would instantly become one of the

00:11:19.550 --> 00:11:22.670
most important people in the world.

00:11:22.670 --> 00:11:27.120
For example, just look at this guy who controls
the world’s newspapers.

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:33.510
He is a highly influential person because
he controls so much of the information that

00:11:33.510 --> 00:11:34.940
gets spread around the world.

00:11:34.940 --> 00:11:39.900
But just imagine how much more control you
could have over the world if you could find

00:11:39.900 --> 00:11:46.899
out secret information that the world government
would never want you to share.

00:11:46.899 --> 00:11:51.760
Though I suppose that would make you their
number one target, so maybe you would be better

00:11:51.760 --> 00:11:53.540
to keep your powers a secret.

00:11:53.540 --> 00:12:01.240
To take this one step further, awakening this
power allows you to fire truth bullets that

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:04.899
force people to tell you the truth even if
you aren’t looking right at them.

00:12:04.899 --> 00:12:10.040
However, if that doesn’t quite seem powerful
enough for you, then just wait until you hear

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:16.350
about this next fruit which can literally
make you as powerful as a planet.

00:12:16.350 --> 00:12:22.329
That’s because with the Orbit fruit submitted
by Ofir from Israel, you can manipulate the

00:12:22.329 --> 00:12:25.010
gravitational pull of anything.

00:12:25.010 --> 00:12:29.480
That means that instead of everything naturally
being pulled down to the earth by gravity,

00:12:29.480 --> 00:12:34.320
you could make yourself the center of gravity
for the people and objects around you.

00:12:34.320 --> 00:12:39.490
And just to visualize what this means, if
you make yourself the center of gravity that

00:12:39.490 --> 00:12:43.100
means that things will start to orbit around
YOU.

00:12:43.100 --> 00:12:47.700
So that rock sitting over there will now start
to rotate around you.

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:53.480
And the same goes for people or other objects,
so you could have a ton of people or stuff

00:12:53.480 --> 00:12:56.899
who are naturally pulled around you like your
own little planet.

00:12:56.899 --> 00:13:00.630
Of course, you can also make other things
the center of gravity, but where the power

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:06.690
of this fruit truly lies is being able to
quickly change the center of gravity to confuse

00:13:06.690 --> 00:13:10.740
opponents AND even change the speeds at which
things orbit.

00:13:10.740 --> 00:13:16.790
This would let you gather a bunch of objects
around you and then shoot them off like missiles.

00:13:16.790 --> 00:13:23.120
So yeah, a fruit that would take A TON of
practice, but if you can master it you would

00:13:23.120 --> 00:13:25.730
be a fighting god.

00:13:25.730 --> 00:13:31.010
But I’d personally still rather face that
devil fruit than this next one.

00:13:31.010 --> 00:13:37.139
Because now we have the Tero Tero no mi from
Alex Hinkley, otherwise known as the Terror

00:13:37.139 --> 00:13:38.240
devil fruit.

00:13:38.240 --> 00:13:42.420
And oh boy, does this give me goosebumps.

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:48.730
Because this devil fruit allows you to create
illusions based on your target’s worst nightmare.

00:13:48.730 --> 00:13:53.240
So let’s imagine you are in battle and someone
is attacking you.

00:13:53.240 --> 00:13:59.060
Well simply activate your power and you can
give them a heart attack by scaring them with

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:01.930
their greatest fear.

00:14:01.930 --> 00:14:08.190
Awakening this fruit could even turn the entire
environment into a nightmare realm where you

00:14:08.190 --> 00:14:11.080
basically paralyze your opponents with fear.

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:16.710
However, there is one major downside here
because the illusions aren’t really physical

00:14:16.710 --> 00:14:19.779
so they can’t actually attack the person.

00:14:19.779 --> 00:14:25.149
Also, if your opponent’s worst fear isn’t
something all that terrifying, like fluffy

00:14:25.149 --> 00:14:29.480
pink bunnies or something, then your fruit
is basically worthless.

00:14:29.480 --> 00:14:46.230
Still though, keep 
this 

00:14:46.230 --> 00:15:09.440
fruit away from me.

00:15:09.440 --> 00:15:25.459
One 

00:15:25.459 --> 00:15:40.440
fruit 

00:15:40.440 --> 00:16:09.019
that 

00:16:09.019 --> 00:16:14.270
will never be worthless though is the Eno
Eno no mi submitted by Chris.

00:16:14.270 --> 00:16:19.389
And the idea with this fruit is that you can
empty or fill up anything.

00:16:19.389 --> 00:16:24.380
As a simple example, let’s say you were
thirsty but your water bottle was empty.

00:16:24.380 --> 00:16:28.790
Well, with this fruit, you can fill it back
up with your favorite drink.

00:16:28.790 --> 00:16:32.210
Or if your fridge is running low, you can
fill it up with food.

00:16:32.210 --> 00:16:37.600
However, one major restriction here is that
the things you “fill up” or “empty”

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:41.389
are only temporary, so these changes wouldn’t
last forever.

00:16:41.389 --> 00:16:48.550
Now you might be thinking that’s a pretty
weak fruit, but the true power of this ability

00:16:48.550 --> 00:16:53.170
comes when you move from physically filling
or emptying things to doing the same with

00:16:53.170 --> 00:16:54.370
abstract concepts.

00:16:54.370 --> 00:17:00.209
For example, what if you filled your enemy's
head with the idea that they were your ally,

00:17:00.209 --> 00:17:02.709
so that they fight with you on the battlefield.

00:17:02.709 --> 00:17:07.750
Or say someone saw you sneaking into their
fortress, well then you could “empty”

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:10.289
their memories of having seen you.

00:17:10.289 --> 00:17:15.740
So yeah, anytime we get these kinds of creative
abilities are always just an instant winner

00:17:15.740 --> 00:17:17.140
in my mind.

00:17:17.140 --> 00:17:24.350
However, no one can argue that the Snake Snake
fruit Mythical model Boitata isn’t just

00:17:24.350 --> 00:17:25.449
simply amazing.

00:17:25.449 --> 00:17:31.070
And this idea from P.H Minduim from Brazil
centers around the mythological Boitata creature

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:32.820
from Brazilian folklore.

00:17:32.820 --> 00:17:37.070
Basically, this is a giant snake with a few
special abilities.

00:17:37.070 --> 00:17:43.549
First, the snake is constantly covered with
flames, so it has the ability to manipulate

00:17:43.549 --> 00:17:44.549
fire.

00:17:44.549 --> 00:17:48.910
In addition to that it can create optical
illusions to confuse its enemies.

00:17:48.910 --> 00:17:56.550
But its ultimate ability is called the Eye
Devourer, which will allow the user to steal

00:17:56.550 --> 00:18:00.990
an opponent’s vision from one eye, which
means they are blind in the one eye unless

00:18:00.990 --> 00:18:05.539
they can defeat the giant snake within a certain
period of time.

00:18:05.539 --> 00:18:11.200
I mean wow, what a terrifying ability.

00:18:11.200 --> 00:18:17.390
Then on top of all the normal benefits of
zoan fruits, you are literally an enormous

00:18:17.390 --> 00:18:23.419
snake with unstoppable power and defense,
which truly makes this fruit a devastating

00:18:23.419 --> 00:18:24.760
combat ability.

00:18:24.760 --> 00:18:31.540
This next fruit though is 100% the most cursed
ability in this entire video.

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:37.510
Because Moses D. Fraud from Italy submitted
the Dead devil fruit, which gives its user

00:18:37.510 --> 00:18:43.570
a ton of death related powers that could completely
break the one piece world.

00:18:43.570 --> 00:18:48.210
For example, Moses suggested that this fruit
allows the user to both communicate with the

00:18:48.210 --> 00:18:51.740
dead AND summon the dead to fight for them.

00:18:51.740 --> 00:18:59.520
And while the summoning part is obviously
overpowered I do think that being able to

00:18:59.520 --> 00:19:04.190
communicate with the dead is quite important
as well.

00:19:04.190 --> 00:19:09.740
Just imagine being able to talk with Gol D.
Roger or Joy Boy.

00:19:09.740 --> 00:19:15.500
Seriously, just think of all the secrets you
could learn.

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:20.190
However, this kind of broken fruit we simply
must have restrictions.

00:19:20.190 --> 00:19:25.500
So I think it would be fair if you can only
summon the dead if you have part of their

00:19:25.500 --> 00:19:27.390
body or skeleton or something.

00:19:27.390 --> 00:19:32.909
Plus, since summoning the dead is such a cursed
ability, let’s add the downside that using

00:19:32.909 --> 00:19:39.030
this ability drains your own life as well,
which means the more you use the power the

00:19:39.030 --> 00:19:42.350
faster you die.

00:19:42.350 --> 00:19:45.540
Fitting for a Dead devil fruit.

00:19:45.540 --> 00:19:52.440
Now prepare yourselves, because it is time
for the ultimate devil fruit: the Fruit Fruit

00:19:52.440 --> 00:19:58.780
no mi or as I like to call it, the Devil Fruit
Devil fruit.

00:19:58.780 --> 00:20:04.440
And just like it sounds, this devil fruit
allows you to create other devil fruits for

00:20:04.440 --> 00:20:06.320
non-devil fruit users to eat.

00:20:06.320 --> 00:20:13.520
Which is such a broken ability and sounds
like an unstoppable power for a pirate captain

00:20:13.520 --> 00:20:14.520
to have.

00:20:14.520 --> 00:20:18.260
However, you cannot just mass produce infinite
devil fruits though because the fruits that

00:20:18.260 --> 00:20:20.039
you can create are only temporary.

00:20:20.039 --> 00:20:26.260
Plus the more of these devil fruits you create
at one time, the weaker they all are.

00:20:26.260 --> 00:20:32.350
Which means if you create one single lightning
fruit, it will be pretty close to as powerful

00:20:32.350 --> 00:20:38.270
as the normal one, but if you make one hundred
lightning fruits at the same time, they will

00:20:38.270 --> 00:20:39.559
all be pretty weak.

00:20:39.559 --> 00:20:44.380
You also have to consider that the people
eating these fake fruits would be brand new

00:20:44.380 --> 00:20:49.299
to the powers, so they aren’t going to be
masters of their powers like most devil fruit

00:20:49.299 --> 00:20:53.610
users we see in the story.

00:20:53.610 --> 00:20:59.650
Still, being able to have your crew switch
powers every hour or so would be insanely

00:20:59.650 --> 00:21:00.650
cool.

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:06.500
You don’t get any real abilities for yourself
though, so that holds it back a bit when compared

00:21:06.500 --> 00:21:10.990
to the unbelievable powers coming up next.

00:21:10.990 --> 00:21:16.320
There is nothing holding back this next fruit
though because it is literally the mythical

00:21:16.320 --> 00:21:18.070
god of the underworld.

00:21:18.070 --> 00:21:25.720
That’s right, this is the Human Human Mythical
Zoan fruit: model Hades, which was submitted

00:21:25.720 --> 00:21:26.720
by Benji.

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:31.290
And if you don’t know, Hades is the Greek
god of the underworld.

00:21:31.290 --> 00:21:36.779
And of course we can’t include ALL of the
underworld ruler’s powers in this devil

00:21:36.779 --> 00:21:43.070
fruit since that would be just too OP, but
we can give it the ability to summon his guardian

00:21:43.070 --> 00:21:48.710
three-headed dog Cerberus, use his magical
helmet that turns him invisible, and maybe

00:21:48.710 --> 00:21:54.080
some other dark magic regarding the underworld
or the dead like reviving people who have

00:21:54.080 --> 00:21:55.980
recently died or something like that.

00:21:55.980 --> 00:22:01.200
On top of all that, the user of the Hades
fruit would become a massive figure, kinda

00:22:01.200 --> 00:22:03.250
like this golden Buddha here.

00:22:03.250 --> 00:22:10.190
And of course being this big has many natural
benefits including super strength and durability,

00:22:10.190 --> 00:22:15.049
so all together this is just one incredibly
powerful devil fruit.

00:22:15.049 --> 00:22:22.140
However, even the God of the underworld isn’t
strong enough to compete with this next fruit,

00:22:22.140 --> 00:22:27.270
which is actually rumored to already exist
in the one piece world.

00:22:27.270 --> 00:22:33.630
This is the Blow Blow fruit, otherwise known
as the Wind fruit.

00:22:33.630 --> 00:22:37.909
Now, there are different versions of this
fruit, but the one Harley from the United

00:22:37.909 --> 00:22:42.919
States submitted is basically a wind Logia
which turns you into a wind human.

00:22:42.919 --> 00:22:48.090
This means your body is now made of wind,
allowing you to fly.

00:22:48.090 --> 00:22:53.910
In addition, you can produce wind to make
devastating tornadoes or wind slashing attacks.

00:22:53.910 --> 00:22:58.909
And of course this is an unbeatable fruit
when it comes to sailing in the one piece

00:22:58.909 --> 00:23:04.390
world, since you can steer your ship anywhere
you want to go, including in the Calm Belt.

00:23:04.390 --> 00:23:09.840
And one thing that makes this fruit even more
impressive is its possible awakening.

00:23:09.840 --> 00:23:14.730
For this fruit, an awakening would allow you
to control the air in the environment, and

00:23:14.730 --> 00:23:19.560
one possible use of this is that you can suck
the air out of the area around someone making

00:23:19.560 --> 00:23:22.540
it so they can’t breathe.

00:23:22.540 --> 00:23:29.679
Seriously, don’t mess with air power

00:23:29.679 --> 00:23:34.830
And with the wind powers, we are truly into
the god-tier abilities and that continues

00:23:34.830 --> 00:23:38.539
with the Particle devil fruit submitted by
Bret from the United States.

00:23:38.539 --> 00:23:45.559
This INSANE ability allows the user to deconstruct
and reconstruct matter into any shape or form

00:23:45.559 --> 00:23:48.039
that they want.

00:23:48.039 --> 00:23:54.700
Remember the build fruit we discussed earlier,
this is like that times 10 because you can

00:23:54.700 --> 00:23:59.250
reshape the resources around you into any
shape that you want.

00:23:59.250 --> 00:24:03.590
To put it simply, you can take a bunch of
materials and break them down into their core

00:24:03.590 --> 00:24:04.630
element.

00:24:04.630 --> 00:24:07.370
Then you can put them back together however
you want.

00:24:07.370 --> 00:24:12.240
For example, if you had a pile of wooden boards,
you could break them down and reconstruct

00:24:12.240 --> 00:24:14.250
them as one single tree.

00:24:14.250 --> 00:24:19.210
Or if you had a giant stone castle, you could
break it down and reform it into a giant stone

00:24:19.210 --> 00:24:20.210
cannon.

00:24:20.210 --> 00:24:27.740
Or really whatever you wanted as long as it
is made of stone.

00:24:27.740 --> 00:24:35.340
Which if that sounds like you need five university
degrees to use, you are probably right because

00:24:35.340 --> 00:24:41.399
it would take A TON of practice to not mess
up every time you had to put things back together.

00:24:41.399 --> 00:24:48.659
But man, once you figured it out, this would
be such an incredibly powerful and versatile

00:24:48.659 --> 00:24:51.510
ability to use anywhere and anytime.

00:24:51.510 --> 00:24:57.130
But now, we finally get to the fruit that
you’ve all been waiting for.

00:24:57.130 --> 00:25:02.760
Because this was the number one submitted
fruit in the entire contest.

00:25:02.760 --> 00:25:07.630
And even though I didn’t put it in the first
video, I just had to include it here.

00:25:07.630 --> 00:25:15.310
This is of course the Water logia devil fruit,
and I chose Umar from Denmark’s submission

00:25:15.310 --> 00:25:16.310
here.

00:25:16.310 --> 00:25:21.429
And just like it sounds, this gives you the
ability to turn your body into water, which

00:25:21.429 --> 00:25:26.450
lets you move around as a quick stream of
water, shoot out bursts of water, or even

00:25:26.450 --> 00:25:29.480
create a giant flood to dominate a battlefield.

00:25:29.480 --> 00:25:35.779
However, I do have to clarify, this fruit
doesn’t give you the ability to just control

00:25:35.779 --> 00:25:41.490
ALL water like some people assume.

00:25:41.490 --> 00:25:46.370
Usually for Logia’s you can only control
the substance that you produce from your own

00:25:46.370 --> 00:25:52.790
body, so you could only control water that
you produce from your body yourself.

00:25:52.790 --> 00:25:57.070
Which is still incredibly overpowered, but
it’s not like you could control the entire

00:25:57.070 --> 00:25:59.260
ocean or something like that.

00:25:59.260 --> 00:26:05.700
It’s debatable if this fruit would even
work though, since obviously water is the

00:26:05.700 --> 00:26:07.950
main weakness of devil fruits.

00:26:07.950 --> 00:26:15.059
But assuming it does work, then it would be
a huge advantage against any other devil fruit

00:26:15.059 --> 00:26:16.059
user.

00:26:16.059 --> 00:26:24.059
But even the water fruit is hard countered
by this next fruit, which is the Seal devil

00:26:24.059 --> 00:26:26.039
fruit submitted by Wisdom from Nigeria.

00:26:26.039 --> 00:26:32.510
Now this fruit is not this kind of seal but
instead it allows the user to seal anything,

00:26:32.510 --> 00:26:33.990
like trapping it away.

00:26:33.990 --> 00:26:39.000
For example, you could seal a rushing river
and then release it at the right time.

00:26:39.000 --> 00:26:42.240
Or you could seal a door so no one can open
it.

00:26:42.240 --> 00:26:48.960
Which honestly sounds kinda boring until you
consider that you can also seal abstract things

00:26:48.960 --> 00:26:54.130
such as memories, movement, strength, or even
devil fruit abilities.

00:26:54.130 --> 00:26:59.600
Which I mean come on, if you can seal those
and prevent someone from using them then this

00:26:59.600 --> 00:27:03.350
truly is just an insanely broken fruit.

00:27:03.350 --> 00:27:06.990
Wisdom did include some pretty fair restrictions
though.

00:27:06.990 --> 00:27:13.789
Like you can only seal one thing at a time
and that each seal comes with a unique condition

00:27:13.789 --> 00:27:16.200
that will break the seal.

00:27:16.200 --> 00:27:22.419
For example, if you sealed Luffy’s strength,
then he might have to do 1000 push ups to

00:27:22.419 --> 00:27:28.700
break the seal and use his true strength again.

00:27:28.700 --> 00:27:34.909
Which is just awesome and exactly the kind
of creative devil fruit idea that I just love

00:27:34.909 --> 00:27:35.909
to see.

00:27:35.909 --> 00:27:47.360
However, nothing on this list is as creative,
broken, or useful as the Author fruit submitted

00:27:47.360 --> 00:27:50.039
by Ricardo Cardona from the United States.

00:27:50.039 --> 00:27:56.049
Because with this fruit you gain the ability
to summon a magical book and an area of effect

00:27:56.049 --> 00:27:59.660
box, similar to Law’s room.

00:27:59.660 --> 00:28:06.039
Then any story you write into the book becomes
reality within your area of effect.

00:28:06.039 --> 00:28:11.850
So let’s say that you are fighting a really
strong opponent.

00:28:11.850 --> 00:28:16.799
Then using your powers you can write a short
story including the character which says that

00:28:16.799 --> 00:28:21.000
they were blinded sometime in their childhood.

00:28:21.000 --> 00:28:29.019
Well, the magic book will literally force
the character to be blind while they are within

00:28:29.019 --> 00:28:34.460
the area of effect.

00:28:34.460 --> 00:28:36.130
Get the idea?

00:28:36.130 --> 00:28:41.600
What’s more interesting about this fruit
though is that the area of effect gets larger

00:28:41.600 --> 00:28:46.861
the more skilled the user of the fruit is,
so eventually you could influence an entire

00:28:46.861 --> 00:28:48.880
battlefield like Marineford.

00:28:48.880 --> 00:28:54.299
However, the strength of the fruit also depends
on the user’s skill with writing stories.

00:28:54.299 --> 00:28:58.510
Because I can just imagine that a simpler
story might cause a weaker effect while a

00:28:58.510 --> 00:29:03.419
more complex story would make the powers stronger.

00:29:03.419 --> 00:29:08.200
I do wonder though what would happen if the
Author devil fruit went up against the mythical

00:29:08.200 --> 00:29:09.539
Zodiac fruit.

00:29:09.539 --> 00:29:14.130
Or if the Water devil fruit user had to fight
against the Blood devil fruit, and if you

00:29:14.130 --> 00:29:19.799
want to see exactly what those fruits are
all about, you can watch the first part of

00:29:19.799 --> 00:29:22.399
this devil contest right here.

00:29:22.399 --> 00:29:31.309
Shanks for watching and I’ll see you in
the next one.

